ndoff_general. Do not claim success unless the tool result is positive. Thank the customer and say goodbye before final close_call; use transferred/human. If a promise was already recorded, the transfer outcome still takes precedence. No tool follows close_call.", "tools": [{"_tool_ref": "handoff_general"}], "transitions": [{"target_node": "terminal", "description": "The human-request disposition is selected", "condition": {"logic": "or", "conditions": [{"variable": "terminal_outcome", "operator": "equals", "operand": "transferred"}]}}]}, "support_handoff": {"name": "support_handoff", "node_type": "conversation", "task_message": "For a customer who accepted support after mentioning illness, a family death, or job loss, call handoff_support. Do not make a persuasion attempt. Do not claim transfer success unless the result is positive. Thank the customer and say goodbye before the final close_call; use transferred/support. No tool follows close_call.", "tools": [{"_tool_ref": "handoff_support"}], "transitions": [{"target_node": "terminal", "description": "Support transfer disposition selected", "condition": {"logic": "or", "conditions": [{"variable": "terminal_outcome", "operator": "equals", "operand": "transferred"}]}}]}}}
